I</strong><br>There is minimal use of UI and menus. Instead of bars that keep track of hunger, heat, stamina, etc, this is communicated via effects and sounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic survival</strong> <br>Whispers of the sands is partially a survival game, but you can decide how difficult it will be. Managing your heat is key since it generates thirst. Movement generates heat, Exposure to the Sun or fire generates heat. Stillness and the night generate cold.  <br>Caves negate both heat and cold, while wind makes the heat hotter and the cold colder.<br>Pay attention and let the desert teach you how to find food, water, ingredients and useful items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Meditation</strong><br>Meditation is not just a visual gimmick but is based on true meditation techniques and spiritual insights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream world</strong><br>In sleep, you enter a dreamworld where you may remember lessons learned and find new connections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong><br>Whispers of the sands is a mere framework in which the player co-creates reality and meaning.<br>Make a journey that mirrors real challenges on the road to enlightenment<br>Learn stories from past desert dwellers, such as a dervish dancer and an ancient cave dwelling people </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spi-fi</strong><br>Journey into a \u201cspiritual fiction\u201d fantasy world with spiritual themes from Sufism, Nondualism, Vedanta, Taoism, Zen and Buddhism </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poetry</strong><br>Relevant poems will accompany your journey from poets such as Rumi and Ibn Arabi, 13th - 12th century Sufi mystics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UE5 technologies</strong><br>A seamless vast open desert to explore with day and night cycle<br>Nanite models and Lumen lightning<br>True blacks: Optimized for OLED screens and HDR, deep dark areas are 100% black </p></li></ul>",
